# .trivyignore
# Vulnerabilities in npm's own bundled dependencies (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm/).
# These packages are part of the npm CLI tool itself and are NOT in our application's
# node_modules. The npm CLI is never executed at runtime (only during image build).
# These are accepted risks until the upstream npm project ships patched bundled versions.

# brace-expansion in npm internals
CVE-2026-14257
CVE-2026-69152

# ip-address in npm internals
CVE-2026-69192

# tar in npm internals
CVE-2026-73566
